{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "act16d5_level_act16d5_08_beg",
  "groupId": "act16d5",
  "stageId": "act16d5_08",
  "title": "大梦",
  "storyCode": "WR-8",
  "avgTag": "行动前",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act16d5/level_act16d5_08_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "f169a928278f1627eb8688384ea351eb519c4f377c0643ff2f7956afa85cfeb0",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "墨魉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_143",
      "text": "......嘎啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黎",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_139",
      "text": "墨魉，墨，魉，多好的名字。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黎",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_139",
      "text": "嵯峨那个孩子，是个天生慧根的好苗子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黎",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_139",
      "text": "一次又一次保护着根本不会受损的器物，那是不是总会有一次，他们放弃了心中的那份正义，对这种徒劳的道德感到麻木呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黎",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_139",
      "text": "也许会吧。如果瓷器能够轻松恢复原状，砸碎它就不会感到心疼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黎",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_139",
      "text": "不，你甚至会爱上砸碎它的感觉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "墨魉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_143",
      "text": "......嘎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黎",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_139",
      "text": "可是，又何必做这么绝呢......人性是经不起考验的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "墨魉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_143",
      "text": "......嘎唔......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黎",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_139",
      "text": "你看着这里吗？夕？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黎",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_139",
      "text": "你这么坏心眼......可要原谅我接下来的小心思哦？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "speakerId": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "text": "——呼！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌有",
      "speakerId": "char_455_nothing",
      "text": "二位恩人，总算解决啦......！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌有",
      "speakerId": "char_455_nothing",
      "text": "可真不是我泼冷水，继续陪着这些怪物耗下去，咱们何日才能找到离开这里的线索？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "speakerId": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "text": "嵯峨说，她会想办法的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌有",
      "speakerId": "char_455_nothing",
      "text": "那咱们就在这儿日复一日地对付墨魉？这也不是什么好事儿吧......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "speakerId": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "text": "......没关系，不费劲。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "speakerId": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "text": "就当钻研自己的法术了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛丝",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_144",
      "text": "——小炎熔。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "speakerId": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "text": "嗯？怎么了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛丝",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_144",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "speakerId": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "text": "说呀？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛丝",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_144",
      "text": "......你刚才使用的源石技艺，稍微有点危险了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "speakerId": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "text": "......我......？啊......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛丝",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_144",
      "text": "看到了？你烧毁了不少铺子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛丝",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_144",
      "text": "还有你啊，小乌有。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛丝",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_144",
      "text": "你刚才是不是有刻意对那只冲向镇子的小墨魉视而不见？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌有",
      "speakerId": "char_455_nothing",
      "text": "我那不是相信恩人一定会处理好的嘛......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛丝",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_144",
      "text": "不，你想的是，“万一出了什么差错，第二天也会变回原样的”。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌有",
      "speakerId": "char_455_nothing",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌有",
      "speakerId": "char_455_nothing",
      "text": "不......我不会否认......就算我心里有数，但......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛丝",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_144",
      "text": "今天是第七天。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛丝",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_144",
      "text": "我不是强人所难，守卫没有意义的目标，日复一日，迟早是会变成这样的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛丝",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_144",
      "text": "别忘了在雷姆必拓的那个月......那是场血淋淋的教训。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛丝",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_144",
      "text": "战斗是会折磨人心的，我们该时刻警醒一点。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "speakerId": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "text": "克洛丝......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛丝",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_144",
      "text": "抱歉......小炎熔，你知道的，我一直......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "speakerId": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "text": "好了，我知道。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "speakerId": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "text": "我们不会有事的，我们会安安稳稳离开这里，安安稳稳回到罗德岛。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛丝",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_144",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛丝",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_144",
      "text": "好~回去之后请我喝哥伦比亚咖啡哦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "speakerId": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "text": "嗯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "speakerId": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "text": "嵯峨还在房间里？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌有",
      "speakerId": "char_455_nothing",
      "text": "我今儿出门前去看过一眼，大师已经枯坐整七天啦......恩人呐，你说要真不吃不喝死在这画里......会真死了吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "speakerId": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "text": "不知道。当时嵯峨只说“交给我吧”，然后二话不说就关门不出了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "speakerId": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "text": "最了解现在情况的人就是嵯峨，我们也别无选择，或者你想像她一样，去其他画卷游览一番？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌有",
      "speakerId": "char_455_nothing",
      "text": "不不不不，免了免了。我可不如大师那么坚定，一个不留神，就彻底出不来了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "speakerId": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "text": "......在嵯峨那边有什么结果前，我们也没什么能为她做的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黎",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_139",
      "text": "原来你们在这里。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "speakerId": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "text": "黎小姐？你来做什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黎",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_139",
      "text": "来提醒你们，莫要偏离本心。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黎",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_139",
      "text": "“假作真时真亦假，无为有处有还无”，我过去这么劝过嵯峨。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黎",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_139",
      "text": "对了，她人呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "speakerId": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "text": "嵯峨已经在房间里冥想许多日了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黎",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_139",
      "text": "......啊，她想醒去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黎",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_139",
      "text": "很少有人能主动从画卷中醒去，不，是从来没有人能够做到。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黎",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_139",
      "text": "不过......说不定呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黎",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_139",
      "text": "炎熔小姐，你听说过，“爆竹”这种东西吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黎",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_139",
      "text": "在大炎，这是一种古老的民俗，当然，起源于——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "speakerId": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "text": "——驱逐古老的怪物？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黎",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_139",
      "text": "哎呀......炎熔小姐是异乡出身的萨卡兹吧？竟然还会对大炎传统有研究？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "speakerId": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "text": "......不是，是我那个朋友......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛丝",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_144",
      "text": "啊。我想起来了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "speakerId": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "text": "你可以别想起来。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛丝",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_144",
      "text": "是《洪炉示岁》里的剧情吧？说年害怕爆竹，最后的玄极巨兵也是用护城炮——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "speakerId": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "text": "——啊啊啊，我不要听！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "speakerId": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "text": "黎小姐！爆竹和现在的情况有什么联系吗！？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黎",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_139",
      "text": "嗯？啊......我想，那些墨魉其实也是惧怕爆竹的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黎",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_139",
      "text": "只要把爆竹悬在城镇入口，那些墨魉，自然就不敢靠近啦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "speakerId": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "text": "真的！？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌有",
      "speakerId": "char_455_nothing",
      "text": "哎哟，那可太方便啦，总算不用日复一日守在这儿了，我腰都酸啦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌有",
      "speakerId": "char_455_nothing",
      "text": "那事不宜迟，咱们赶紧去镇上集市瞧瞧——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黎",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_139",
      "text": "集市里，自然是没有这种东西的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌有",
      "speakerId": "char_455_nothing",
      "text": "——我想也是啊。那咋整？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黎",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_139",
      "text": "总有办法的......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黎",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_139",
      "text": "爆竹，为什么要叫爆竹？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌有",
      "speakerId": "char_455_nothing",
      "text": "......是因为最早的大炎子民，为了纪念先帝的丰功伟绩，以火烧竹子的方法，纪念那场旷世大战......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛丝",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_144",
      "text": "你知道的还挺多嘛。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌有",
      "speakerId": "char_455_nothing",
      "text": "哈哈，没事看看杂书，杂书......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黎",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_139",
      "text": "那就行了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黎",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_139",
      "text": "给它们准备一个惊喜吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黎",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_139",
      "text": "就这棵，不是挺好吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌有",
      "speakerId": "char_455_nothing",
      "text": "欸......我看这棵长得还挺好看的，有点可惜......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黎",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_139",
      "text": "反正明天会再长出来的啦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌有",
      "speakerId": "char_455_nothing",
      "text": "您倒是一点不客气啊......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "speakerId": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "text": "我来了，这些够不够？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黎",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_139",
      "text": "越多越好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛丝",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_144",
      "text": "煮伞先生也真是好说话，就这么把竹子白送给我们啦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黎",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_139",
      "text": "若是过意不去，回头我去向他道声谢就是。我那当铺，永远不会有人赎东西，干脆就送了吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "speakerId": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "text": "这不合适吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黎",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_139",
      "text": "反正明天就会变回原样的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛丝",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_144",
      "text": "唔，我是见过柴火噼里啪啦的样子，竹子会更响吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黎",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_139",
      "text": "听说雨后湿竹更加响亮，不过，罢了，这儿可不会下雨。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黎",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_139",
      "text": "对，就这样......垒成一个土灶......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黎",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_139",
      "text": "火的话——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "speakerId": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "text": "——我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黎",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_139",
      "text": "......可控制点火候啊，这里头有点学问的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "speakerId": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "text": "我、我试试看......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌有",
      "speakerId": "char_455_nothing",
      "text": "恩人！它们来啦！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黎",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_139",
      "text": "现在！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "speakerId": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "text": "唔——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "墨魉",
